# --- Rust build artifacts (workspace arrives in PR-1) ---
/target
**/target
target/

# Per-crate Cargo registries are transient; keep them local.
# NOTE: Cargo.lock is intentionally NOT ignored — for a binary/application
# workspace we commit it for reproducible builds.

# --- Local environment / secrets ---
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key

# --- Editor / IDE ---
.vscode/
!.vscode/settings.json
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.fleet/
.zed/

# --- OS files ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# --- Tooling caches (local only; never policy/config) ---
# Keep these ignored, but explicitly do NOT ignore project config such as
# deny.toml, rust-toolchain.toml, rustfmt.toml, clippy.toml, .github/, etc.
# Python: the docs-linkcheck checker is stdlib-only, but running it locally
# creates __pycache__ bytecode that must never be committed.
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.cache/
*.log
